# Project-scoped secrets for tooling. One copy for the whole project.
#
# Every agent on this project reads THIS file. Do not export a personal key in
# your own shell and do not commit your own credentials anywhere: the point of
# the project-scoped file is that attribution of a change never depends on whose
# machine or account produced it.
#
# Blank value = feature off. The default update path (`-Mode code-only`) needs
# no secret at all, so a missing or empty key degrades to code-only rather than
# failing.
#
# graphify deep mode (semantic extraction of vault markdown):
GEMINI_API_KEY=
